    "DocumentSocketGrantReceiptV1": {
      "description": "The answer to a document open-plan exchange (POST /spaces/{space}/documents/{document}/socket-grants): the actor the next `semio.session.v1` upgrade of the same credential is admitted as, and until when. It carries no secret: the upgrade presents the session or share credential itself, and the hub admits the oldest pending grant of that credential's binding.",
